The deterministic formula-artifact repair is complete. Canonical 1,000-part formulas and artistic architecture were not changed. All 1 mL, 5 mL and 30 mL dose exports were recomputed from exact four-decimal formula parts using Decimal arithmetic, and all nine successor formula hashes were regenerated.

