## V19/V20 policy boundary

- No universal material-count minimum was used as authority.
- No row-count PASS/FAIL verdict was issued.
- No aggregate complexity score or quality score was generated.
- Formula signatures, anti-chassis dimensions and n-ary interaction records remain separate diagnostic objects.
- Quarantined recovered parent packages were not imported.
- Product-basis active fractions remain unknown unless independently declared.
- Planned active-equivalence arithmetic is not physical measurement.

## Remaining block

The formula-artifact defect is repaired, but 63 exact stock/preparation/lot/strength/species/procurement rows remain open. V20 runtime hardening is still undeployed, and four exact-byte dependencies remain missing. Quick verification therefore remains on HOLD.
